; notes = EXPERIMENTAL. One print profile from this machine's ideaMaker 5.4.2.8790 Hyper Speed PLA jobs. Measured: 0.20 mm layers, 0.30 mm first at 50 mm/s, 0.40 mm lines (0.48 first), walls 150, small/overhang walls 75, infill/solid/support 120, tops 100, gap 100, travel 150, Z 5, retract 1.5 at 40 / unretract 25, wipe after full retract. Accel 2000/5000. PrusaSlicer cannot emit the 50-75-100-125-150 layer ramp, first-layer travel 50, first-layer FLOW 90%, or top FLOW 106%. Bridge 30 mm/s at 90% flow is not in those files (no BRIDGE type). Wipe tower stays PrusaSlicer (X50 Y140, relative E).
